#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:1
#: ac700059c32f483f950704f566adcec4
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:3
#: ad01a4ee15bf444891bff783bb36c968
msgid ""
"A local editor routes claims through bounded drafting, verification, "
"provenance, and optional retrieval services."
msgstr ""
"Un editeur local achemine les affirmations par une redaction bornee, une "
"verification, une provenance et des services de recuperation optionnels."

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:5
#: e52f9b8b274243a39d5e47e68cb1abd0
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:11
#: a47e0e77bccb4856956851416c108eab
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:13
#: 0358b8b61f80420f9fc2234f6b4f7de1
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:15
#: 10da6081d99a4a9994507d64dbf3feef
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/architecture.md:17
#: b03acb71867e44b0ba516260d92f78e3
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."
